  "description": "You might think this is Masi's first foray into Gravel but our roots actually go much deeper. When Faliero welded his first frame one hundred years ago he knew riders would need to contend with rough dirt, cobbles, and country roads battered by winter rains. Gravel is in our blood, and an integral part of our history. It only makes sense that on our 100th anniversary we set our roots down in very familiar dirt.\n\nOltre Strada is a platform inspired by Faliero's original vision. Beyond Road - A bike that can handle tough gravel, sketchy single track, steep winding descents and still outsprint the rest on road. Oltre Strada is your quiver killer - one bike to rule them all. Fast aero geometry, big tire clearance, internal storage, a suspension corrected front end, with no sacrifices made on big gearing so when you are hit the pavement you can drop a gear and disappear.\n\nGet ready to go Beyond Road",
